Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> statement
Rule 1     statement -> FROM endpoint TO endpoint
Rule 2     statement -> FROM endpoint TO endpoint where_clause
Rule 3     endpoint -> IP_ADDRESS COLON NUMBER
Rule 4     endpoint -> IP_ADDRESS AT MAC_ADDRESS
Rule 5     endpoint -> IP_ADDRESS COLON NUMBER AT MAC_ADDRESS
Rule 6     endpoint -> IP_ADDRESS
Rule 7     endpoint -> MAC_ADDRESS
Rule 8     condition -> FIELD OPERATOR VALUE
Rule 9     condition -> FIELD OPERATOR NUMBER
Rule 10    condition_list -> condition
Rule 11    condition_list -> condition_list COMMA condition
Rule 12    where_clause -> WHERE condition_list

Terminals, with rules where they appear

AND                  : 
